  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "漢語語言學概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO CHINESE LINGUISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "介紹漢語的語音、詞彙、語法、語義、語用以及漢字的內涵與特色；繼而透過漢語語言學和對外漢/華語教學的相關探討以及書面和口頭報告，期使學生能將漢語語言學的專業知識融於日常語言表達及對外漢/華語文教學中。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the Chinese phonetics, lexis, grammar, semantic meaning, pragmatics and the connotation and characteristics of Chinese characters , and also discusses the relevant written and oral reports related to Chinese linguistics and Chinese teaching. Students can apply the knowledges of Chinese linguistics to everyday language and Mandarin Chinese teaching .",
